{"applicability_conditions":"适用于 M1-30 和 M2-30 钢。其中 M1 钢在时效后析出 κ-碳化物；M2 钢在固溶态析出 (Ti,V)C 碳化物，时效后析出 κ-碳化物，两类析出均提高屈服强度。","identity":{"block_id":"b0058","equation_id":"equation_001","equation_number":"1","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {y} = \\sigma_ {0} + \\sigma_ {G} + \\sigma_ {D} + \\sigma_ {P}\\tag{1}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmrt.2025.05.166"},"latex":"\\sigma_{y} = \\sigma_{0} + \\sigma_{G} + \\sigma_{D} + \\sigma_{P}","purpose":"将屈服强度表示为基体强度、晶界强化、位错强化和析出强化各贡献项之和，用于定量描述 M1-30 和 M2-30 钢的屈服强度。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"屈服强度","symbol":"\\sigma_{y}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"基体强度（包括晶格摩擦应力和固溶强化）","symbol":"\\sigma_{0}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"晶界强化（grain-boundary strengthening）","symbol":"\\sigma_{G}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错强化（dislocation strengthening）","symbol":"\\sigma_{D}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"析出强化（precipitation strengthening）","symbol":"\\sigma_{P}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["晶界强化 σ_G 采用 Hall–Petch 关系描述（见式 2）","该关系引用了文献 [43,44]"]}